Send frames while no window is open.

ferriscope drew nothing until the application opened its first window, so
Moonlight got no video while Steam started and gave up after ten seconds. It
now sends a black frame at once and repeats it each second, as for any screen
that does not change.

Not upstream yet. Applies to the ferriscope crate that Moonshine vendors.

